  "name": "alexandria-web-client",
  "description": "A web-based client interface for the Alexandria library management system, developed for the Clarkson Open Source Institute. It implements a search-and-display workflow using jQuery and Bootstrap 3, backed by a Flask-based Python server for API simulation and asset serving. The application manages book metadata, including ISBNs and availability, through dynamic DOM manipulation and asynchronous request handling.",
